      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but i think it's a little too brief. our production editor is looking for recipes that feel more \"complete\" and detailed so the novice cooks feel totally guided through every part of the process. \n\nsince the thoroughness score is based on those ingredient mentions, could you try a version that's a bit more robust? i'm not asking you to spam the words, but try to be much more descriptive with the steps so the ingredient count is higher and more comprehensive. basically, just make it feel more \"thorough\" for the software without being annoying to read.",
